menu "TrailGuard wearable"

config TRAILGUARD_PAIRING_BUTTON_GPIO
    int "Pairing activation button GPIO"
    range -1 48
    default -1
    help
        GPIO connected to a physical momentary button wired to ground.
        The device only advertises pairing and signs a challenge for 60 seconds
        after this button is pressed. Confirm the board's actual wiring before
        building; no GPIO is selected by default.

config TRAILGUARD_PAIRING_WINDOW_SECONDS
    int "Pairing activation window in seconds"
    range 10 60
    default 60

endmenu
